OL,3,GNEWSACharity sees more than 1,000 dog
OL,4,Arehoming requests
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal centre in Warwickshire says
OL,7,Fit has so far this year received 1,284
OL,8,Finquiries from people looking to give
OL,9,Fup their dogs.
OL,11,FAmid the demand for its rehoming
OL,12,Fservice, Dogs Trust Kenilworth is
OL,13,Fspotlighting its Homestay project,
OL,14,Fwhich enables pets to remain in their
OL,15,Fcurrent home while the charity searches
OL,16,Ffor a suitable new one.
OL,18,FThe service was created due to kennels
OL,19,Fand foster homes being "consistently
OL,20,Ffull", the charity said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
