OL,3,GNEWSACharity sees more than 1,000 dog
OL,4,Arehoming requests
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If giving up a dog is the right
OL,7,Fchoice, we'll support owners every step
OL,8,Fof the way and find them the best
OL,9,Foption to rehome their dog," said Jake
OL,10,FFlatman, head of rehoming at the
OL,11,Fcharity.
